{
    "background_story": "Dumpling was a mysterious, planet-dwelling creature from a distant galaxy. Its existence was marked by an insatiable hunger for energy, which it satisfied by consuming entire star systems. Dumpling's method of annihilation was unlike anything seen before - it would envelop a planet in a dark, misty aura, slowly draining its energy until nothing remained. The creature's path of destruction was unstoppable, leaving behind a trail of desolate, lifeless worlds. As Dumpling approached the Andromeda galaxy, the inhabitants of a small planet called Zorvath attempted to defend themselves. But Dumpling's power was too great, and the planet was reduced to a mere memory. The creature's annihilation of Zorvath served as a warning to the rest of the galaxy: Dumpling was a force to be feared, and its hunger would never be satiated.",
